@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #42566B
  LifeLineBorderColor #8295A8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #D8EAFE
  ActivationBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  ParticipantFontColor #172B4D
  ActorBorderColor #42566B
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  GroupBorderColor #8295A8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
  GroupHeaderFontColor #172B4D
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  DividerBorderColor #8295A8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #BBA86A
  FontSize 12
}
hide footbox
title
UC-P07 - Check Out a Private EV
<size:11>Preconditions: Student is signed in and has a parking-session reference.</size>
end title
actor Student as ST
boundary "Student Portal" as UI
control "ParkingController\n(Parking Service)" as SVC
entity "Mobility Records" as DATA
control "Charging Service" as CHG
participant "Charging Adapter\n(IoT or Simulator)" as DEVICE

ST -> UI: Check out private EV
activate UI #D8EAFE
UI -> SVC: Get checkout context (sessionRef, vehicle)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> DATA: Load owned matching parking session and latest linked charging state
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Current context / already closed / invalid or unavailable / retrieval error
deactivate DATA
SVC --> UI: Checkout context, existing completion or explicit error
deactivate SVC
alt missing, not owned or vehicle mismatch
UI --> ST: Generic unavailable session; no occupancy change
else already checked out
UI --> ST: Show existing completion result; do not release resources again
else current parking or charging state unverifiable
UI --> ST: No checkout or release; retry after current data is available
else verified Active parking with Active charging
UI --> ST: Charging must stop before checkout; ask Student whether to stop
else verified Active parking without Active charging
UI --> ST: Proceed to latest checkout summary
end
deactivate UI
break invalid or unverifiable context, or already checked out

end
opt linked charging is Active
ST -> UI: Accept or decline charging stop
activate UI #D8EAFE
alt Student declines stop
UI --> ST: End attempt with parking still Active
else Student accepts stop
UI -> CHG: Stop linked charging (sessionRef)
activate CHG #D8EEDC
CHG -> CHG: Verify session and ownership
activate CHG #D8EEDC
CHG --> CHG: Access valid / invalid
deactivate CHG
alt access invalid
CHG -> CHG: Prepare authentication-required / denied result
activate CHG #D8EEDC
CHG --> CHG: No stop command requested
deactivate CHG
else access valid
CHG -> DEVICE: Request charging stop (chargingSessionRef)
activate DEVICE #FFE3BF
DEVICE --> CHG: Command accepted / rejected
deactivate DEVICE
note over CHG,DEVICE
  Command acknowledgement does not confirm charging stopped.
end note
opt command accepted
... Wait for confirmed stopped state or failure/timeout ...
opt stopped state confirmed
DEVICE -> DEVICE: Observe confirmed stopped state
activate DEVICE #FFE3BF
DEVICE ->> CHG: Charging stopped (sessionRef, final battery / energy)
activate CHG #D8EEDC
deactivate DEVICE
CHG -> DATA: Record Completed if target met; otherwise Interrupted
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> CHG: Final charging state recorded / persistence error
deactivate DATA
deactivate CHG
end
end
end
CHG --> UI: Stop outcome: confirmed final state / access invalid / failed / unconfirmed
deactivate CHG
alt final charging state confirmed
UI --> ST: Charging ended; reload summary before departure confirmation
else access invalid, stop failed or final state unconfirmed
UI --> ST: Parking stays Active; point not treated as free; restore access / seek assistance
end
end
deactivate UI
end
break stop required and declined, denied, failed or still unconfirmed

end
UI -> UI: Refresh checkout view
activate UI #D8EAFE
UI -> SVC: Reload latest checkout summary
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> DATA: Reload owned parking and linked charging states and allocations
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Current states and summary version / already closed / inaccessible / retrieval error
deactivate DATA
opt owned Active parking and current linked states verified
loop each linked Pending/Scheduled charging request
SVC -> SVC: Collect request and allocation to cancel in the summary
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Append current request/version and affected allocation
deactivate SVC
end
end
SVC --> UI: Current checkout summary / state or access error
deactivate SVC
alt visit already closed
UI --> ST: Show existing completion result; no second release
else latest state unavailable, inaccessible or charging Active again
UI --> ST: No checkout; resolve state/access and repeat stop flow if charging is Active
else owned Active parking verified with no Active charging
UI --> ST: Review departure, unused Pending/Scheduled requests and all releases
end
deactivate UI
break visit already closed, latest state unavailable, inaccessible or charging Active again

end
ST -> UI: Confirm departure or cancel checkout
activate UI #D8EAFE
alt Student declines, edits or abandons
UI --> ST: Parking stays Active; any confirmed charging stop remains effective
else Student confirms
UI -> SVC: Confirm departure (sessionRef, summaryVersion, operationRef)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> SVC: Recheck session and permission
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Current access result
deactivate SVC
alt session expired or permission denied
SVC -> SVC: Prepare authentication-required / access-denied result
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: No update attempted
deactivate SVC
else session valid and permission granted
critical Final state check and complete checkout together
loop each unused request shown in the confirmed summary
SVC -> DATA: Revalidate request state, allocation and summary version
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Matches / changed / unverifiable
deactivate DATA
end
SVC -> DATA: Close owned visit with actual unrounded departure only if charging is not Active\nand ALL dependent checks succeed and consequences match confirmed summary
activate DATA #E2E7ED
note over SVC,DATA
  Close visit and complete reservation; cancel unused requests.
  Release occupied space and all remaining holds once.
end note
DATA --> SVC: Completed / already closed / charging Active / summary changed / verification error / save failure
deactivate DATA
end
opt update outcome uncertain / response lost
SVC -> DATA: Find original checkout result (operationRef, studentId)
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Original result / still unknown
deactivate DATA
end
end
SVC --> UI: Operation outcome and accessible current details
deactivate SVC
alt access invalid
UI --> ST: Sign in if permitted; reload current records and confirm again
else outcome still unknown
UI --> ST: Outcome unconfirmed; retain operationRef and resolve original result before retry
else save failed
UI --> ST: Report failure; no partial update; retry after reload and revalidation
else charging became Active or cancellation consequences changed
UI --> ST: No checkout; repeat stop flow if needed, reload summary and confirm departure again
else current state unverifiable or record no longer accessible
UI --> ST: No checkout/release; resolve state or access before retrying
else checkout completed or already closed
UI --> ST: Show Closed session, Completed reservation, departure and charging outcomes
end
end
deactivate UI
note over ST,DATA
  Keep occupancy until checkout, even after reserved departure.
end note

footer Smart E-Mobility Hub | Submission 2 | Parking & Private EVs
@enduml
